    "Earlier logits are close under the declared tolerance.",
    "The changed suffix affects later logits."
  ],
  "verification_plan": [
    "Use eval/no_grad; retain a suffix-sensitive control so a constant-output model fails."
  ],
  "execution_claim": "No execution performed."
}

